{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】於宏福苑大火中殉職消防員何偉豪的未婚妻，於社交平台發文悼念。</p>\n<p>何偉豪未婚妻Kiki表示，何偉豪離世後人生發生改變，祝願遇難168位死者家屬可以笑著提起何偉豪。而何偉豪的胞兄亦於社交平台發文，他說有到廣福休憩處獻花。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T15:23:54.157087+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:04:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:17:26.502909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:17:26.502909+00:00","content_hash":"167ef266b984feca3082d1cb4d1c66776fba342bd5b64afd24a709906adbe68d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}